  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added zone leaderboards, club-specific campaign lists, and creation and editing of club rooms from dedicated servers to `NadeoLiveServices`\n- Added paginated account record overloads to `NadeoServices`\n- Fixed saved credentials and concurrent token refresh for clients sharing a handler\n- Fixed automatic token refresh waiting until the token expired\n- Fixed rejected `PendingCredentials` being sent again on every request\n- Fixed club activity folder filtering, the submitted map review route, trophy and submitted map redirects, and URL escaping\n- **Changed `MatchParticipant.Leaver` from `string?` to `int?`** to match API responses. Update code that reads or constructs this record\n- Made JSON converters public for external serialization\n- Updated the User-Agent to report the installed package version\n- Added .NET 11 support",
